= A note in a styled region

Outside, a marker^[An outer note.] takes the default rules.

#!aside(style: {color: "#555555"})
#{ $.set({role: 'fn-marker'}, {color: '#a8432a'}) }
#{ $.set('code', {color: '#2f5d8a'}) }
Inside the grey region a scoped rule colours its markers^[A note whose `code` keeps the rule of its place.] red.
#aside!

After the region, a marker^[A later note.] is plain again.
